<div>
    <div class=3D"cmp-text is-really-first">
        <p>The era of incremental technology change is over. In the span of=
 a few years, artificial intelligence has leapt from automating tasks to di=
smantling and rebuilding the very structure of the technology organization.=
<sup><a href=3D"https://www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/topics/technology-m=
anagement/tech-trends/2026/ai-future-it-function.html#endnote-1" aria-label=
=3D"Endnotes reference number 1">1</a></sup>&nbsp;Consider that 78% of tech=
 leaders anticipate broad, targeted, or transformational integration of AI =
agents into architecture workflows over the next five years, according to D=
eloitte=E2=80=99s 2025 Horizon Architecture Survey.<sup><a href=3D"https://=
www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/topics/technology-management/tech-trends/20=
26/ai-future-it-function.html#endnote-2" aria-label=3D"Endnotes reference n=
umber 2">2</a></sup></p>

    </div>
</div>

   =20

</div>
<div class=3D"text cmp-di-text pr-0 pl-0 pl-mob-2 pr-mob-2 aem-GridColumn--=
phone--12 cmp-di-text--line-height-large aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--def=
ault--12">

   =20

<div class=3D"hide-no-results-error-msg">
    <img src=3D"https://www.deloitte.com/content/dam/insights/icons/svg/ico=
n-alert.svg"> =20
</div>
<div>
    <div class=3D"cmp-text ">
        <p>Yet this is more than a shift in tools and headcount. AI is reen=
gineering how technology teams are structured, governed, and led.&nbsp;Tomo=
rrow=E2=80=99s model will likely be leaner, faster, and infused with AI at =
every layer=E2=80=94from architecture to delivery=E2=80=94transforming the =
tech organization into a dynamic engine that continuously learns and optimi=
zes.</p>
<p>=E2=80=9CAgents and people will soon be completely integrated in terms o=
f how work gets done, and it=E2=80=99s going to happen really fast=E2=80=94=
faster than most companies are ready for,=E2=80=9D says Tracey Franklin, ch=
ief people and digital technology officer at Moderna. =E2=80=9CCompanies ne=
ed to get better at constant road mapping and iteration because the era of =
'build it once and forget it' is over.=E2=80=9D<sup><a href=3D"https://www.=
deloitte.com/us/en/insights/topics/technology-management/tech-trends/2026/a=
i-future-it-function.html#endnote-3" aria-label=3D"Endnotes reference numbe=
r 3">3</a></sup></p>
<p>While there=E2=80=99s no single, definitive blueprint for structuring a =
tech organization for an AI-driven world, the path forward is coming into v=
iew. Tomorrow=E2=80=99s high performers won=E2=80=99t just keep pace with A=
I, they=E2=80=99ll let it propel them into entirely new terrain. The questi=
on for every leader today is not whether AI will transform the tech org, bu=
t how quickly they can harness its full potential.</p>

    </div>
</div>

   =20

</div>
<div class=3D"text cmp-di-text pr-0 pl-0 pl-mob-2 pr-mob-2 aem-GridColumn--=
phone--12 cmp-di-text--line-height-large aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--def=
ault--12">

   =20

<div class=3D"hide-no-results-error-msg">
    <img src=3D"https://www.deloitte.com/content/dam/insights/icons/svg/ico=
n-alert.svg"> =20
</div>
<div>
    <div id=3D"AI-reshaping-tech" class=3D"cmp-text ">
        <h2>How AI is reshaping the tech organization</h2>
<p>Deloitte=E2=80=99s Tech Spending Outlook finds that 64% of surveyed orga=
nizations plan to increase AI investments over the next two years<sup><a hr=
ef=3D"https://www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/topics/technology-management/=
tech-trends/2026/ai-future-it-function.html#endnote-4" aria-label=3D"Endnot=
es reference number 4">4</a></sup>=E2=80=94a clear sign that leaders recogn=
ize the substantial value and transformative potential AI can deliver acros=
s the enterprise. While most acknowledge they=E2=80=99re still in the explo=
ratory phases of generative and agentic AI (figure 1), data shows how AI is=
 reshaping the tech organization in many ways, from priorities and people t=
o purpose.</p>

    </div>
</div>

   =20

</div>

